{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>網上流傳一條影片，一男子在啟德隧道坐電動輪椅逆線於右邊行駛。警方昨晚（17日）10時許，接獲啟德隧道公司盧姓男職員報案，截停涉事61歲梁姓男子清醒及無受傷。事主表示因迷路而誤闖隧道範圍，警方其後送事主回家，案件列作「誤會」，暫無可疑。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.234933+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:39:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:19.073191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:00:03.953576+00:00","content_hash":"13671d8d914907764e60ec81fd11c3d644790e29b7e67dc88ceee208bc60cd86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.234933+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}